w: 1.~All peo- ple that on earth do dwell, sing to the Lord with cheer- ful voice.
w: 2.~Know that the Lord is God in- deed; With- out our aid he did us make;
w: 3.~O en- ter then his gates with praise, Ap- proach with joy his courts un- to:
w: 4.~For why? The Lord our God is good, His mer- cy is for- ev- er sure:
