w: Serve him with fear, his praise forth tell, come ye be- fore him and re- joice!
w: We are His flock, he doth us feed, And for His sheep He doth us take.
w: Praise, laud, and bless his Name al- ways, For it is seem- ly so to do.
w: His truth at all times firm- ly stood, And shall from age to age en- dure.
